takeoff.weather:
Not recommended with WEST-winds;
Prohibited with NORD-winds ('Mistral')!!!

On the FFVL-frequency, the wind from Trainon is transmitted about every 10-15min

takeoff.takeoff_description:
N and S TO at end of paved road (HG/ PG);
or continue on dirt road to top:
ramp for S TO, fields for S and N TO (HG/ PG)

takeoff.going_there:
- l'Aiguille/ laSapiniere:  Chamrousse > 'Recoin' village: follow 'Club Alpin Français' signs, park your car just before their chalet on   your left in the last turn. Walk 20 mn. Don't forget water...
-la Croix: walk from 'Recoin' village > 1hr;
or: take cable car: https://www.chamrousse.com/ouverture-tarif-via-ferrata-telecabine-telesiege.html

takeoff.takeoff_description:
Two take-offs on each side of the 'col des Aravis' pass :
- south at the top of the Etale lift ; west or east ;
- north on the different ski slopes ; any open lift in summer ?

landing.landing_description:
- Mont Serein. 1400m   >> mot allowed in Winter (during skiing activities)!
- Savoillans: N44 10 47.0 E5 22 35.0, 510m;
- Bedoin: N44 07 30.4 E5 11 06.4, 522m.
